OL,3,AWinter energy prices expected to rise
OL,4,Ato three-year high
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirms say energy debt has jumped and,
OL,7,Fwith high bills likely to persist, have
OL,8,Fcalled for more support for those
OL,9,Fstruggling to pay. The government says
OL,10,FVAT is being cut from electricity
OL,11,Fbills.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
