OL,3,AYellow warnings in force as rain and
OL,4,Athunderstorms hit parts of UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FDownpours and thunderstorms will
OL,7,Fcontinue to bring the risk of flooding
OL,8,Fto parts of the UK on Wednesday.
OL,10,FA Met Office yellow warning for
OL,11,Fthunderstorms is valid from 03:00 until
OL,12,F22:00 BST, covering much of the
OL,13,FMidlands, parts of northern, eastern
OL,14,Fand southern England, as well as the
OL,15,Ffar east of Wales.
OL,17,FThe rain could be heavy enough to bring
OL,18,Fflash flooding and travel disruption,
OL,19,Fwith lightning and large hail posing
OL,20,Fadditional hazards.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
