OL,3,ANicotine vapes best chance to quit
OL,4,Asmoking, major review finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmokers who want to quit have the best
OL,7,Fchance of doing so if they use nicotine
OL,8,Fe-cigarettes, a review has found.
OL,10,FThe Cochrane team looked at 80 major
OL,11,Ftrials involving nearly 30,000 people
OL,12,Fand found that nicotine vapes were more
OL,13,Feffective than traditional aids such as
OL,14,Fpatches, gum and support plans -
OL,15,Fincreasing the success rate by about
OL,16,F60%, from around six in every 100
OL,17,Fmanaging to quit smoking to one in
OL,18,Fevery 10.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
