OL,3,AChina hits out at 'illegal' new US
OL,4,Asanctions on Iran and trading partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis came after US Treasury Secretary
OL,7,FScott Bessent announced the new
OL,8,Fmeasures on Monday, warning any nation
OL,9,Ffinancially partnering with Iran would
OL,10,Fbe isolated.
OL,12,FChina is the biggest buyer of Iranian
OL,13,Foil, although the trade has declined
OL,14,Funder the US blockade of Iran's ports.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
